      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While rest and good nutrition are crucial for recovery, the symptoms you described—especially heart fluttering and chest heaviness—are concerning and don't typically warrant self-diagnosis. Since you are worried about costs, consider reaching out to a local community health clinic or urgent care center, as they often have lower-cost options. Please prioritize speaking with a medical professional to ensure these symptoms are not related to something more serious.",
      "source": "target",
