      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even if anxiety is a factor, the combination of shortness of breath and cardiac sensations requires professional clearance, as self-treating heart-related symptoms can be dangerous. Instead of high-dose supplements, focus on small, consistent steps like steady hydration and light, controlled activity. If these symptoms worsen or persist significantly after a few days of dedicated rest, please seek advice from a telehealth service or a low-cost health resource.",
      "source": "target",
